ce on checking and updating collations.",[191,206,208],{"id":207},"_2-database-dsn-collation-parameter-incorrect","2. Database DSN Collation Parameter Incorrect",[196,210,211],{},"When configuring your database connection string (DSN), ensure that the collation parameter matches the server's collation. For example:",[213,214,220],"pre",{"className":215,"code":217,"language":218,"meta":219},[216],"language-text","DB_USER:DB_PASS@tcp(DB_HOST:DB_PORT)\u002FDB_NAME?collation=utf8mb4_unicode_ci&loc=Europe%2FBerlin\n","text","",[221,222,217],"code",{"__ignoreMap":219},[196,224,225,226,229,230,232],{},"If the server uses ",[221,227,228],{},"utf8mb4_unicode_ci",", but your DSN specifies ",[221,231,228],{},", this mismatch can cause issues. Update the DSN to use the correct collation parameter.",{"title":219,"searchDepth":234,"depth":234,"links":235},2,[236],{"id":189,"depth":234,"text":182,"children":237},[238,240],{"id":193,"depth":239,"text":194},3,{"id":207,"depth":239,"text":208},"Troubleshooting common installation issues related to database configuration and migrations.","md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fconfiguration\u002Fcommon-installation-issues",{"title":182,"description":241},"1.getting-started\u002F5.configuration\u002Fcommon-installation-issues","B8zwm1dAU2kD6F0Df6Z1dVvlPx--usVT-03bJYAtVJA",[251,256],{"title":252,"path":253,"stem":254,"description":255,"children":-1},"Advanced Configuration","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fconfiguration\u002Fadvanced","1.getting-started\u002F5.configuration\u002F7.advanced","Advanced configuration topics for monitoring, proxies, storage, and external integrations.",{"title":31,"path":257,"stem":258,"description":259,"children":-1},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fgameserver\u002Ffivem-plugin\u002Finstallation","1.getting-started\u002F6.gameserver\u002F1.fivem-plugin\u002F1.installation","Install the FiveNet FiveM plugin to connect your gameserver to your FiveNet instance.",1787913104660]